{"id":"5721","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5721_main_funnel-cloud-cold-air-funnel_hydrometeors-special-clouds-and-other-features.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">漏斗云</span>是一种龙卷。该冷空气漏斗是从英国威尔士南部沿海上空不稳定气流中的积状云底发展而成。</p>\n<p>图中这类冷空气漏斗源于局部对流和与浓积云或积雨云有关的切变涡旋，而与大规模中尺度气旋无关。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Tim Bow","location":"英国，威尔士，波斯考尔，雷斯特湾","latitude":"纬度: 51° 29' 30'' N","longitude":"经度: 3° 43' 23'' W","date":"07 October 2014 1817 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.11.5.1.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.11.5.1.5"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5721_syn_funnel-cloud-cold-air-funnel_hydrometeors-special-clouds-and-other-features.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"></div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5721_upper_funnel-cloud-cold-air-funnel_hydrometeors-special-clouds-and-other-features.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>英国西南端的英格兰坎伯恩的高空廓线在近午时约到420 hPa都是不稳定的。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}